hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"884","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hudaibiya key saal nikley. To Aap key sahaaba ne ehraam baandha aur main ne ehraam na baandha. To hamein Ghaaiqa mein dushman ki khabar di gai. To ham unki taraf mutawajjeh huey. To merey saathiyon ne jangli gadha dekha aur un mein se baaz baaz ki taraf hansney lagey. To main ne dekha aur use dekha. To main ne us par ghoda daudaaya aur use nezah maara aur use saabit kar diya. To main ne un se madad maangi aur unhon-ne meri madad se inkaar kya. To ham ne us mein se khaaya, phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jaa mila aur hamein khauf tha ke ham kat jaaengey. Main apna ghoda kabhi daudaaeta aur kabhi us par chalta. To main raat key darmiyaan mein Bani Ghifaar key aik aadmi se mila. To main ne kaha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kahaan chhoda? To us ne kaha: Main ne unhey Tahan mein chhoda jabke wo Suqya mein dopahar guzaar rahey they. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jaa mila yahan tak ke Aap key paas aaya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Aap key sahaaba ne bheja hai, Aap ko salaam aur Allah ki rehmat aur uski barkatein kehtey huey. Aur beshak unhey khauf hai ke dushman unhey Aap se kaat dega, to unka intezaar kijiye. To Aap ne aisa kya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham ne jangli gadha shikaar kya hai aur hamaarey paas bacha hua hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaaba se farmaya: Khaao, jabke wo ehraam baandhey huey they. (Bukhari: 1821)"
"885","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se aik riwayat mein hai ke jab wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ne use us par hamla karney ka hukm diya ya uski taraf ishaara kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To uskey gosht mein se jo baaqi hai khaao. (Bukhari: 1824)"
"886","[AI-translation] Abu Qataada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Qaaha mein they jo Madina se teen (marhalon) par hai. Aur ham mein ehraam baandhney waley aur baghair ehraam key they. Hadees. (Bukhari: 1823)"
"887","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Saab bin Jassaama Laisi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jangli gadha tohfey mein diya jabke Aap Abwa ya Waddaan mein they. To Aap ne use us par wapas kar diya. Phir jab Aap ne uskey chehrey mein jo tha dekha to farmaya: Ham ne use tum par sirf isliye wapas kya ke ham ehraam baandhey huey hain. (Bukhari: 1825)"
"888","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jaanvaron mein se paanch sab faasiq hain jo Haram mein qatl kiye jaaengey: Kawwa aur cheel aur bichhu aur chuha aur kaatney wala kutta. (Bukhari: 1829)"
"889","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Mina mein ghaar mein they ke Aap par (Walmursalaat) naazil hui. Aur beshak Aap use padh rahey they aur beshak main use Aap key munh se ley raha tha. Aur beshak Aap ka munh us se tar tha. Ke ham par saanp kooda. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use qatl karo. To ham uski taraf dauday aur wo chala gaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo tumhaarey shar se bachaaya gaya jaisey tum uskey shar se bachaaey gaey. (Bukhari: 1830)"
"890","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chhipkali key liye farmaya: Chhota faasiq. Aur main ne Aap ko usey qatl karney ka hukm detey huey nahi suna. (Bukhari: 1831)"
"891","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Makkah fatah honay key din farmaya: Hijrat nahi hai lekin jihaad aur niyat hai. Aur jab tumhey nikalney key liye kaha jaey to niklo. (Bukhari: 1834)"
"892","[AI-translation] Ibn Buhaina (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne seenghi lagwaai jabke Aap ehraam baandhey huey they, Lahy Jamal mein apne sar key darmiyaan mein. (Bukhari: 1836)"
"893","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Maimoona se nikaah kya jabke Aap ehraam baandhey huey they. (Bukhari: 1836)"
"894","[AI-translation] Abu Ayyub Ansaari se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ehraam baandhey huey apna sar kaisey dhotey they? To Abu Ayyub ne apna haath kapdey par rakkha aur use jhukaaya yahan tak ke mujhey unka sar zaahir hua. Phir us insaan se kaha jo un par (paani) daal raha tha: Daalo. To us ne unkey sar par daala. Phir unhon-ne apna sar apne donon haathon se hilaaya. To unhey aagey laaey aur peechey ley gaey. Aur kaha: Main ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 1840)"
"895","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatah key saal daakhil huey jabke Aap key sar par khud tha. Phir jab Aap ne use utaara to aik aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Beshak Ibn Khatal Kaaba key pardon se chipka hua hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use qatl karo. (Bukhari: 1846)"
"896","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Juhaina ki aik aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai. To us ne kaha: Beshak meri maan ne Hajj ki nazr maani thi aur wo Hajj na kar saki yahan tak ke faut ho gai. To kya main uski taraf se Hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, uski taraf se Hajj karo. Batao agar tumhaari maan par qarz hota to kya tum ada karteen? Allah ka (qarz) ada karo, Allah wafa ka zyada haqdaar hai. (Bukhari: 1852)"
"897","[AI-translation] Saaeb bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Hajj karaaya gaya jabke main saat saal ka tha. (Bukhari: 1858)"
"898","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne Hajj se wapas aey to Umm Sinaan Ansaariya se farmaya: Tumhey Hajj se kis ne roka? Unhon-ne kaha: Abu fulaan, yaani unkey shohar, key paas do paani laanay waley oont they. Wo un mein se aik par Hajj key liye gaya aur doosra hamaari zameen seerab karta hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Ramazan mein Umrah merey sath Hajj ko pahunchta hai. (Bukhari: 1863)"
"899","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baarah ghazwaat kiye they. Unhon-ne kaha: Chaar (baatein) main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sunein ya farmaya: Wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kartey they. To wo mujhey pasand aaein aur mujhey achhi lagein: Ke aurat do din ki raah ka safar na karey jabke uskey sath uska shohar ya mehram na ho. Aur Eid-ul-Fitr aur Baqra Eid key do din rozah na ho. Aur do namazon key baad namaz na ho: Asr key baad yahan tak ke sooraj ghurub ho jaey aur Subah key baad yahan tak ke sooraj nikley. Aur safar ka saamaan na baandha jaey magar teen masjidon ki taraf: Masjid-e-Haraam aur meri masjid aur Masjid-e-Aqsa. (Bukhari: 1864)"
"900","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik budhey ko dekha jo apne donon beton key darmiyaan sahara liye huey tha. Aap ne farmaya: Iska kya haal hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Us ne paidal chalney ki nazr maani hai. Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah iskey apne aap ko azaab deney se beniyaaz hai. Aur use sawaar honay ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 1865)"
"901","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Meri behan ne Baitullah ki taraf paidal chalney ki nazr maani aur mujhey hukm diya ke main uskey liye Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se fatwa poochhun. To main ne Aap se fatwa poochha. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use paidal chalna chaahiye aur sawaar hona chaahiye. (Bukhari: 1866). Madina key fazaael."
